===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|chalk}}, {{m|enm|chalke}}, from {{der|en|ang|ċealc}}, from {{inh|en|gmw-pro|*kalk}}, borrowed from {{der|en|la|calx||limestone}}, again borrowed from {{der|en|grc|χάλιξ||pebble}}. {{doublet|en|calx}} and {{m|en|cauk}}.

